; The operation record's payload (tag 20, schema 1): format 1 (draft), SPEC.md section 14.
; CDDL by RFC 8610. The first rule is the one a payload is validated against; op-path and name-id
; are names.cddl's rules, content-id is record.cddl's, read together with this file.
operation = [op: op-path, name: tstr, version: uint, inputs: [* operation-input], params: bstr, budget: [work: uint, logical-bytes: uint]]
operation-input = [0, body: content-id] / [1, entity: name-id]
